========================================================================
KEY IMPROVEMENTS IN THIS ANALYSIS
========================================================================
1. FIXES CLAHE edge artifacts:
   - Pads borders before CLAHE processing
   - Crops after Otsu thresholding
   - Result: NO MORE BLACK/WHITE FRAMES!

2. 4-panel architecture comparison:
   - Panel 1: Original image
   - Panel 2: UNet prediction (inverted)
   - Panel 3: Attention UNet prediction (inverted)
   - Panel 4: Attention ResUNet prediction (inverted)

3. DUAL visualization sets:
   - SET 1: Fixed contrast (vmin=0, vmax=1)
     └─> For comparison with previous results
   - SET 2: Auto contrast (vmin/vmax from actual data)
     └─> Shows actual min/max range in title
     └─> Proves auto-contrast is working!

4. FIXED tile indexing bug:
   - Previous version accessed tiles by wrong list index
   - Now matches tiles by (image_name, tile_idx)
   - Result: Tiles CORRECTLY CORRELATED between architectures!

5. Boxplots for threshold 0.5:
   - Full dilution range (1/10240 to 1/10)
   - Low dilution range (1/10240 to 1/80)
   - Grouped comparison of all 3 architectures

6. Custom colormap for auto-contrast tiles:
   - RED pixels = minimum value
   - CYAN pixels = maximum value
   - Grayscale = middle values
   - Result: VISUALLY PROVES auto-contrast is working!

7. Same tiles in both sets (fair comparison)
